          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 13 2018 16:32:48 GMT-0400",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Reduce Falls by 50%</span></span></p>\n<p>Stryker’s iBed Wireless Financial Guarantee: Our program guarantees a 50% reduction in bed-related falls occurring on standardized Stryker beds equipped with Wireless technology<sup>4</sup>. Personnel training and more make up this risk sharing program.&nbsp;<br>\n</p>\n",
