          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 13 2018 16:32:48 GMT-0400",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Reduce Pressure Injuries by 30%</span></span></p>\n<p>Stryker’s program guarantees a 30% reduction in hospital-acquired pressure injuries when using our support surfaces<sup>5</sup>. Personnel training and more make up this risk sharing program.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Dec 20 2018 20:15:55 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
