          "line2": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">Stryker’s iBed Wireless Financial Guarantee: We guarantee a 50% reduction in bed-related falls occurring on Stryker beds equipped with Wireless Technology.<sup>4</sup></span></span></p>\r\n",
